1
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:12,670

2
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:12,670

3
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:14,800
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Baran, is this you?

4
00:00:20,470 --> 00:00:24,180
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It began after a bad case of viral meningitis when I was five.

5
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,520
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}They tried every anti-seizure medication,

6
00:00:27,520 --> 00:00:30,730
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but I still had episodes every few months or so.

7
00:00:31,270 --> 00:00:33,900
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}No one's ever noticed before. They just think I'm thoughtful.

8
00:00:36,110 --> 00:00:37,490
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Are you driving?

9
00:00:37,490 --> 00:00:40,620
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I couldn't until laser ablation

10
00:00:40,620 --> 00:00:43,370
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}to my left temporal lobe 12 years ago.

11
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:46,620
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Between that and the Keppra, I've been seizure-free,

12
00:00:46,620 --> 00:00:49,880
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}cleared by Neurology to drive and to work as an attending.

13
00:00:52,250 --> 00:00:55,550
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}How long, uh, between the seizure you had today and the last one?

14
00:00:56,380 --> 00:00:59,220
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It's been well over a year.

15
00:01:01,970 --> 00:01:03,100
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But I had two today.

16
00:01:08,140 --> 00:01:09,600
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I don't know why.

17
00:01:09,600 --> 00:01:13,190
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}It could be sleep deprivation, new job stress.

18
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:16,950
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I--I haven't had to deal with Peds cases since Afghanistan.

19
00:01:17,450 --> 00:01:19,110
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What are your options now?

20
00:01:21,450 --> 00:01:23,080
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}up my Keppra

21
00:01:23,080 --> 00:01:26,450
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}or maybe try one of the newer anti-seizure meds.

22
00:01:26,450 --> 00:01:29,040
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}But if that doesn't work, I'm left with two choices--

23
00:01:30,120 --> 00:01:33,750
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}um, a temporal lobectomy, which could impair my speech,

24
00:01:33,750 --> 00:01:36,210
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}or get a neuromodulation device,

25
00:01:36,210 --> 00:01:39,800
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}which can sense and stop the seizures almost immediately.

26
00:01:39,800 --> 00:01:41,640
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You need to disclose this.

27
00:01:41,640 --> 00:01:43,220
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I know. I have a plan.

28
00:01:43,760 --> 00:01:46,010
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, Robby, Dana's looking for you. She's in Peds.

29
00:01:46,020 --> 00:01:47,310
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah, OK, I'll be right there.

30
00:01:48,690 --> 00:01:51,440
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sounds like you're needed in Peds, and I have patients to see.

31
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:53,980
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Robby, pregnant woman with severe headache

32
00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:55,730
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}on her way in by ambulance.

33
00:01:55,730 --> 00:01:57,610
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Find Abbot or a night shift resident.

34
00:02:01,820 --> 00:02:03,620

35
00:02:03,620 --> 00:02:07,330

36
00:02:13,380 --> 00:02:15,210
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Need you to turn out your pockets.

37
00:02:21,510 --> 00:02:22,970
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}OK. Show me your hands.

38
00:02:51,000 --> 00:02:52,000
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Come here often?

39
00:03:01,380 --> 00:03:02,300
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}What's going on?

40
00:03:03,340 --> 00:03:05,720
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, sorry--false alarm. We thought she spiked a fever,

41
00:03:05,720 --> 00:03:08,350
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}but it was the wrong chart from our analog hell.

42
00:03:09,430 --> 00:03:11,890
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}You know anybody who might consider kinship adoption?

43
00:03:11,890 --> 00:03:15,020
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Doctors and nurses qualify. - Don't look at me.

44
00:03:15,020 --> 00:03:18,320
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Hey, can your staff keep an eye on Dr. Al-Hashimi until she leaves?

45
00:03:18,320 --> 00:03:19,190
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Why?

46
00:03:21,860 --> 00:03:24,780
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Uh, because I think she's tired, and I don't want her to make any mistakes.

47
00:03:24,780 --> 00:03:26,950
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Oh, great advice. Maybe you should take it.

48
00:03:26,950 --> 00:03:28,780
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah. I'm gonna go get some fresh air.

49
00:03:28,790 --> 00:03:30,450
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Grab some for me while you're out there.

50
00:03:30,450 --> 00:03:32,200
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Your lungs wouldn't know what to do with it.

51
00:03:32,210 --> 00:03:34,580
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}- Screw you! - In front of the baby? Nice.

52
00:03:37,670 --> 00:03:38,590
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Yeah.

53
00:03:39,170 --> 00:03:40,960
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We are the night crawlers.

54
00:03:40,960 --> 00:03:44,010
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We deal with the weirdest and the wildest because...

55
00:03:44,010 --> 00:03:46,550
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}We are the weirdest and the wildest of them all.

56
00:03:46,550 --> 00:03:50,310
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}That is right, and tonight, they are really gonna be crawling. Now go get some!

57
00:03:55,810 --> 00:03:56,850
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}Sorry to wake you.

58
00:03:57,520 --> 00:03:58,820
{\fn微软雅黑\fs14}I--I was thinking.
